# Original fictional watershed-monitoring corpus for operational trials.
requirement OPS-RECORD-001
title: Preserve operational evidence
statement:
  The monitoring service shall preserve time-correlated monitoring, alert, and operator-action records for later analysis.
rationale:
  Incident reconstruction and service improvement depend on durable evidence.
end requirement

requirement SYS-RECORD-TIME-001
title: Time-correlate records
statement:
  The service shall associate each retained sample, hazard, notification, and operator action with a common time reference.
decomposes: OPS-RECORD-001
end requirement

requirement TIME-STATION-001
title: Timestamp station records
statement:
  Each station shall timestamp samples and locally detected hazards using its synchronized station clock.
decomposes: SYS-RECORD-TIME-001
end requirement

requirement TIME-SERVER-001
title: Timestamp service records
statement:
  The central service shall timestamp notifications and operator actions using its synchronized service clock.
decomposes: SYS-RECORD-TIME-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-RECORD-RETAIN-001
title: Retain operational records
statement:
  The service shall retain operational records for at least 30 days after their recorded time.
decomposes: OPS-RECORD-001
end requirement

requirement STORE-MONITOR-001
title: Retain monitoring records
statement:
  The record store shall retain qualified samples and station-health observations for the configured retention period.
decomposes: SYS-RECORD-RETAIN-001
end requirement

requirement STORE-ALERT-001
title: Retain alert records
statement:
  The record store shall retain hazards, notifications, acknowledgements, and protected-interaction audit events for the configured retention period.
decomposes: SYS-RECORD-RETAIN-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-RECORD-EXPORT-001
title: Export selected evidence
statement:
  The service shall export selected operational records with their identities, times, and source stations.
decomposes: OPS-RECORD-001
end requirement

requirement EXPORT-SELECT-001
title: Select export interval
statement:
  The export interface shall select operational records by inclusive start and end times.
decomposes: SYS-RECORD-EXPORT-001
end requirement

requirement EXPORT-INTEGRITY-001
title: Identify export integrity
statement:
  The export service shall include an integrity value covering every record and manifest entry in an export package.
decomposes: SYS-RECORD-EXPORT-001
end requirement
